{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/7d810d607a2cbb02cd39bc379089d079.poster.avif?t=1757688609\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/7d810d607a2cbb02cd39bc379089d079.webm?t=1757688609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/7d810d607a2cbb02cd39bc379089d079.mp4?t=1757688609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Gothic Hell: Survivors</strong>  is top-down gothic chaos: 10\u201315 min survival runs with meta progression and loot management between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for <strong>multiplayer</strong>, focused on <strong>single player</strong> at launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Game Formula:</strong>\u00a0VS + PoE / D2 + Co-op</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE A SURVIVOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.poster.avif?t=1757688609\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.webm?t=1757688609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.mp4?t=1757688609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your power, and dive into an atmospheric bullet hell experience that rewards creativity, adaptability, and momentum. No two runs play the same, and each one brings you closer to mastering the madness.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN POWERFUL SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/d96d53dea7945ac7b2a463d4b2f547d5.webp?t=1757688609\" width=760 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master auto-cast spells and reactive movement while unlocking new powers, characters, and passive boosts. Explore layered 3D arenas with vertical challenges, hidden secrets, and dynamic events that make every battle feel fresh and alive.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL BIG BOSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c04bc73b6b73275963746cd2520778.poster.avif?t=1757688609\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c04bc73b6b73275963746cd2520778.webm?t=1757688609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c04bc73b6b73275963746cd2520778.mp4?t=1757688609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...or DIE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/d96d53dea7945ac7b2a463d4b2f547d5.webp?t=1757688609\" width=760 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced bullet hell ARPG with auto-cast spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Loot? A lot!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Meta Progress? Yes!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Unique survivors with game-changing abilities</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ver